  "DivisionNotes": [
    "LevelSpec is a meta-level TLA+ specification describing TLA+ semantic levels and level-checking; it has no VARIABLES, no actions, and no temporal operators.",
    "All correctness checks are encoded as state-predicate operators (xxxNodeLevelCorrect, TypeOK, LevelCorrect, IsOpArg) and assigned to OperatorDefNames_StatePredicate.",
